        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Lignify"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, primal, transmutation)\n\nThe touch of a waldgeist transforms flesh into wood. A living creature damaged by the waldgeist's lignifying root Strike must succeed at a 22 Fortitude save or become slowed 1 (or slowed 2 on a critical failure). Further failed saves against lignify increases the slowed condition. Once a creature's actions are reduced to 0 by lignify, that creature becomes petrified, except they're transformed into wood instead of stone."
            },
            "id": "944cd158-147e-4df5-8a3b-3ff001d2babc",
